            // The user might interpret Duration::ZERO as no timeout or a very short one.
            // A more robust check might be needed if 0,0 specifically means "no timeout"
            // in your application logic, distinct from a 0-duration timeout.
            Ok(Some(timeval_to_duration(tv)))
