    *   **Permutation generation**: Iterate through all (S!) permutations of visiting the S stores. For each permutation, calculate the total distance (house -> store1 -> store2 -> ... -> storeS -> house) using the precomputed distances. Keep track of the minimum. This is O(S! \* S).
